  "description": "Conformance test 1 (§11). A 4 x 4 city, shipped tuning. Street occupants (IsOfType(3) only) answer PathConnection only for path type 1 (car): A = (1,1) has no connections and a turn-around at entry 2; B = (2,1) has (0 -> 2) and (2 -> 0); C = (3,1) a turn-around at entry 0. Inserted A, B, C, then DoPostCityInit. The travel types on network 1 are 1, 2 and 4, so conn[1] = conn[2] = conn[4]: A 0x0400 (bit x + 4e = 2 + 8), B 0x0104 (bits 2 and 8), C 0x0001; connCount 1, 2, 1; type 3; invCap = invCapTable[Street] = 0x3C23D70A; extraCost 0.0. Every other conn word is 0, switch 0xFFFF, priorCar 0xFFFF; no records for other networks. The intersection pass leaves invCap unchanged. GetCapacity(1,2,1) = 100.0 (0x42C80000), GetConnectionCount(1,2,1) = 2, GetCapacity(0,2,1) = 0.0.",
